{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"permission":"api-key-execute","readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Settle claims for the specified markets. There is no calldata to sign or broadcast: the protocol submits each market-local claimPayoutFor transaction itself and pays the gas, since a payout can only ever reach the holder the market names. Each entry in the response is SETTLED (with the transaction hash the protocol sent) or SKIPPED (not yet claimable, with when it will be); claim-all callers continue safely after individual failures. Claim submission applies to onchain markets. Committed markets settle automatically at final resolution; GET /claims/receipts reports exact already-credited payouts. Explicit batch requests return SKIPPED/COMMITTED_SETTLED only after a corroborated payout receipt, with claimed:true and amountAvailable:true. Pending or unproven cases return SKIPPED/NOT_CLAIMABLE_YET, claimed:false and amountAvailable:false; their required amount of zero is an unavailable placeholder, not a credited zero result. No transaction is submitted for a committed market.","inputSchema":{"$defs":{"EvmAddress":{"description":"Checksummed or lowercase 20-byte EVM address (0x + 40 hex).","pattern":"^0x[a-fA-F0-9]{40}$","type":"string"}},"properties":{"idempotencyKey":{"description":"Stable retry key. Reuse only with byte-equivalent tool arguments.","maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"markets":{"items":{"properties":{"chainId":{"description":"Compiled protocol release chain ID (Base 8453).","maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"marketAddress":{"$ref":"#/$defs/EvmAddress"}},"required":["chainId","marketAddress"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":100,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"proofNonce":{"description":"Required single-use nonce for the wallet proof. Fetch from POST /api/auth/nonce; consumed on verification so the proof cannot be replayed.","maxLength":256,"minLength":1,"type